{save true}{false}ifelse}{false}ifelse
11 dict begin
/FontType 1 def
/FontMatrix [0.001 0 0 0.001 0 0 ]readonly def
/FontName /JYAJWZ+CMSY7 def
/FontBBox {-15 -951 1251 782 }readonly def
